ReFUSE File Format Specification
Authority Level: Highest

File Format
Format: XML
Encoding: UTF-8
Extension: .fuse
Root Element
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Preset amplifier="Mustang V2 I/II" ProductId="13">
</Preset>
Required Sections
Amplifier
FX
FUSE Info
Amplifier Rules
Exactly one amplifier.

Amp must contain:

ID
POS
BypassState
ControlIndex 0-22
Amp POS is always 0.

Required Fixed Values
ControlIndex	Value
8	32896
11	32896
21	1
Amp Constants
ControlIndex:

12
13
14
18
must all contain the amp constant associated with that amp model.

Cabinet
ControlIndex 17

Stores cabinet number.

See cabinets.md.

Signal Chain
Amp is fixed.

Effects use POS values between 0 and 7.

Slots:

0-3 = Before amp

4-7 = After amp

Do not duplicate POS values.

Effect Sections
One:

Stompbox
Modulation
Delay
Reverb
per preset.

Empty Sections
Empty effect section:

<Module ID="0" POS="1" BypassState="1"></Module>
Bypass States
Effects:

0 = ON
1 = OFF
Amp:

always 1
Validation
Before export verify:

Valid XML
Valid amp ID
Correct amp constants
Valid cabinet
Correct parameter count
No duplicated POS values
Legal ReFUSE signal chain
